idelines.gov/sites/default/files/2020-07/ScientificReport_of_the_2020DietaryGuidelinesAdvisoryCommittee_first-print.pdf","line":29},{"title":"people more, not less hungry","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23404961/","line":31},{"title":"None","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*Oq5x-WFvzSxei52aCSEx8Q.jpeg","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"25% lower than normal after 3 days of fasting","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15941923/","line":59},{"title":"2–5 times their original sizes","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11818300/","line":75},{"title":"3 inches in diameter in the 1990s compared to 6 inches today","target":"https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/educational/wecan/news-events/matte1.htm","line":75},{"title":"None","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*IaoVvkM8nJbv5nji_XPFRA.jpeg","line":77,"embedded":true},{"title":"Europe are considerably smaller than those in the United States","target":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10855354/","line":81},{"title":"Eating slowly is even more important when eating energy dense foods","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23592679/","line":91},{"title":"eating slowly ate fewer calories but felt more full afterwards","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24388483/","line":91},{"title":"fullness which reduces future snacking by 25%","target":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30591684/","line":91},{"title":"None","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/0*rzljrqqwusp5nZAK.jpeg","line":95,"embedded":true},{"title":"my books","target":"https://www.doctorjasonfung.com/","line":99},{"title":"TheFastingMethod.com","target":"https://www.thefastingmethod.com/","line":99},{"title":"YouTube channel","target":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoyL4iGArWn5Hu0V_sAhK2w","line":99}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"17wqm72","at":1768747602262}},
